---
layout: layouts/index.njk
---
<section id='content'>
  <section>
    <h2>Who I Am</h2>
    <p>I'm Tierney Cyren, an open source maintainer, JavaScript developer, and Developer Advocate. Most recently, I was at Twilio as a Principal Developer Advocate, and prior to that I've worked at Microsoft as a Senior Developer Advocate and at NodeSource as a Developer Advocate. I do work on JavaScript, including Node.js, Electron, npm, and the OpenJS Foundation. Previously, I've worked as a Delegate for Microsoft on TC39.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Blog</h2>
    {%- for post in collections.post | reverse -%}
    <article>
        {% if post.data.series %}
          <h3 class="post-list-entry"><a href="{{ post.url | urlize }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a><span class="no-bold">, part of the</span> <a href="{{ 'series/' + post.data.series | urlize }}">{{ seriesData[post.data.series].title }}</a><span class="no-bold"> series<span></h3>
        {% else %}
          <h3 class="post-list-entry"><a href="{{ post.url | urlize }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
        {% endif %}
        {%- if post.data.page.excerpt -%}
          <description class="post-list-description">{{ post.data.page.excerpt | toHTML | safe}} <a href="{{ post.url | urlize }}" class="post-list-read-more">Continue reading</a></description>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
   </article>
  </section>
</section>